{"unit_id":"tag:0D3P:statement","translation":"在上述情形下，假设 <MATH_0001> 拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated），并且 <MATH_0002>（《空间的导出范畴（Derived Categories of Spaces）》第 <REF_0001> 节）为同构（isomorphism）。则函子（functor）<MATH_0003> 是范畴等价（equivalence of categories）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories of Spaces","target_term":"空间的导出范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"空间性质。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"空间性质。"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories of Spaces","target_term":"空间的导出范畴","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"coherator 映射性质。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"扩张上的函子。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"结论。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0D3P:proof","translation":"回忆，<MATH_0001> 是 <MATH_0002> 的对象（object），见《关于空间态射（Morphisms）的更多内容》引理 <REF_0001>。因此假设蕴含映射（maps）\n<MATH_0003>\n对所有 <MATH_0004> 都是同构（isomorphisms）。由引理 <REF_0002>，这蕴含我们的函子（functor）是全忠实的（fully faithful）。另一方面，由引理 <REF_0003>，此函子（functor）本质满射（essentially surjective），因为两个范畴（categories）中分别有解（solutions）<MATH_0005> 与 <MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"导出范畴中的对象。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间态射","context":"引用章节名中的术语。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"Ext 群之间。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"Ext 映射的性质。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"给定函子。"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实的","context":"函子性质。"},{"source_term":"essentially surjective","target_term":"本质满射","context":"函子性质。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"源与目标范畴。"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解","context":"平凡扩张。"}],"notes":[]}
